icons.woff2 is a subset of JetBrains Mono Nerd Font (https://github.com/ryanoasis/nerd-fonts),
made from JetBrains Mono (https://github.com/JetBrains/JetBrainsMono). The letterforms keep JetBrains
Mono's SIL Open Font License 1.1; its full text is in web/src/fonts/OFL.txt.

The 27 glyphs come from the icon sets Nerd Fonts patches in — Seti UI, Devicons, Codicons, Material
Design Icons — whose licences are listed with the Nerd Fonts project.

Generated, not edited by hand; the command is in docs/git-history.md.
